  - **Real-Time Poly-Economic AGI-ASI Value-Flow Editor (B2)**: Simulates multi-currency economic scenarios.
  - **Real-Time Adaptive SEC-NACHA Compliance Engine (B3)**: Ensures regulatory compliance.
- **Implementation**:
  - Simulate economic scenarios (e.g., job loss, education investment) using AGI to predict outcomes.
  - Integrate BRICS-inspired local currency models to reduce reliance on USD.[](https://www.cfr.org/backgrounder/what-brics-group-and-why-it-expanding)

### 3. Neural Reality Module (Division N, LLCs 0-4)
